# `pipelines.history`

Paginated run-level history rows with pipeline/q filters.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.pipelines.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `limit` | `number` |
| `offset` | `number` |
| `pipeline` | `string` |
| `q` | `string` |

## Returns

`PipelineRunHistoryResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `runs` | `map` |
| `total` | `number` |
| `offset` | `number` |
| `limit` | `number` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call pipelines.history --json '{ "limit": 0, "offset": 0, "pipeline": "", "q": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

